	<Folder id="51F289F54F000001">
		<ex:extension>base64;GgA</ex:extension>
		<name>Bloubank Zones</name>
		<open>1</open>
		<description>Zones set up to enable culling, capture and hunting management

Proposed Hunting/Traverse protocol (see map attached)

We have shared digital calendar (Nico, Marius, Michael and Myself are members) showing dates for booked hunts when they are confirmed
All members of external traverse syndicates will be members of the Bloubank Management WhatsApp Group and the board of Leadwood Homeowners Association 
Leadwood Homeowners Association will post notices to the relevant Leadwood members 14 days in advance of booked hunts
Two days before the start of each hunt - Marius will nominate one or two blocks in which the hunting will commence. 
After a hunt has started then Marius will notify the Bloubank Management WhatsApp Group of any changes to the proposed two selected hunting blocks for the next day by no later than 15h00 on the day before. 
The syndicates will need to make sure they note the changes and either Michael or myself will inform the Leadwood Homeowners Association members of the changes. 
All blocks can be accessed by all traversers after dark on any day. 
Ideally if Marius had a radio on the traverse channel to inform vehicles on Bloubank if a wounding follow up is required so that we can then avoid that area if outside the designated hunting blocks for that time. 

Boundary descriptions 
Block 1 (710 hectares)
Twin Crossings Road to short link to Blouwildebeest Route west of Sandsloot
Blouwildebeest Route onto Sandsloot Pad (West)
Uitkyk Pad
Zebra Pad
Pylplyn Roete
Hoofpad
Spoorsnyers Oos Pad
Leopard’s Bend fence

Block 2 (720 hectares)
Twin Crossings Road to Western Fence from Sandsloot
Western Fence to Lemoendoring Wes Pad
Seskant Krip South to
Seskant Bult Pad
Koedoe Pad Middel
Sandsloot Pad Suid
Sandkamp Pad 
Across the Sandsloot 
Sandsloot Pad 
To Blouwildebeest Roete

Block 3 (810 hectares)
Lemoendoring Wes Pad
Seskant Krip South to
Seskant Bult Pad
Koedoe Pad Middel
Sandsloot Pad Suid
Sandkamp Pad 
Across the Sandsloot 
Uitkyk Pad
Zebra Pad
Hoofpad (Boskamp Roete)
To Madrid Fence
To Main Bloubank Gate

Block 4 (875 hectares)
Madrid fence 
Esem/Riversdale Fence
Spoorsnyers Pad Oos
Hoofpad
Zebra Pad
 Wildefye Route
To Boskamp
Hoofpad to Madrid Fence</description>
		<styleUrl>#__managed_style_0B43FECAD042D6FCFF3C</styleUrl>
